Thanks for checking with me on the call how callbacks are counted. A follow-u=
p on the same case and question does not add another enquiry to the figures.

I've attached the September desk update with the two weeks we compared and th=
e current preparation and refund guidance. Please use it when briefing the de=
sk leads. The existing Support route remains the place to check refund progre=
ss, and the desk should keep the original booking.

Thanks,
Claire

